name: "document/master-delete-vs-apply"
description: "Replica 1 deletes the A5 master page while replica 2 applies it to the page.  The page's master register keeps the reference to the tombstone, so the page reads as an ordinary Letter page (PageList); restoring the master makes it a child again."
